### ============================================================
### 43-Quartz Enterprise Scheduler API Testing (Port: 8143)
### ============================================================

### 1. Lập lịch Cron Job mới (chạy mỗi 10 giây)
POST http://localhost:8143/api/jobs/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "DailyReportJob",
  "jobGroup": "REPORTING",
  "jobClass": "ReportGenerationJob",
  "cronExpression": "0/10 * * * * ?",
  "jobData": {
    "reportType": "FINANCIAL",
    "requestedBy": "Admin"
  }
}

### 2. Tạm dừng Job
POST http://localhost:8143/api/jobs/REPORTING/DailyReportJob/pause

### 3. Tiếp tục chạy Job
POST http://localhost:8143/api/jobs/REPORTING/DailyReportJob/resume

### 4. Xóa Job khỏi Quartz Scheduler
DELETE http://localhost:8143/api/jobs/REPORTING/DailyReportJob
